  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Myanmar Decentralizing Funding to Schools Project 2016 - 2020</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Myanmar Decentralising funding to School Project (DSFP) aims at improving learning outcomes in primary education. The additional financing of the project (AF) aimed at expanding the existing DSFP until 2021 with the objective of improving inclusiveness of school funding management and enhancing support to teachers&apos; professional development while increasing transition rates of poor and at-risk students. 
There are 4 main activities under AF-DFSP:
1) Teacher Mentoring and Cluster Support Programme;
2) School Improvement Support Programme (SISP);
3) Student Stipends Programme; and
4) Strengthen Monitoring and Implementation of Programme.</narrative>
  </description>
